      "message": "Add TEE service group\n\nAdd a new TEE service group to allow multiple REEs and TEEs,\noptionally on top of host and trusted hypervisors, to communicate\nwith each other, synchronously and asynchronously, and to\nexchange (share, lend and donate) memory.\n\nSigned-off-by: Christian Bolis <cbolis@qti.qualcomm.com>",
